  {
    "id": 1023001050020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あは～♡　いい反応～～～！\r\nこれから帰るとこ？　駅まで一緒に行く？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
