  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "え～～～……、\r\nもしかしてまだお仕事ある～？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "明日じゃだめなやつ～？\r\n今日はもうやめとこうよ～……ね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、もうこのまま帰るつもりだから\r\n大丈夫だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "それならよかった～\r\nプロデューサーは働きすぎ～～～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……でも、お仕事が楽しくて\r\nしあわせ～って感じなら、それはいいことなのかもね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………雛菜\r\nこの間の話だけどさ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～～～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……悪かった、雛菜の話をちゃんと聞かずに\r\n押し付けるようなことを言った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\n雛菜もずっとプロデューサーのこと考えてた～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050090,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だけどやっぱり他の誰かみたいにはなれない～\r\n雛菜は雛菜で、みんなじゃないもん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050100,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜、透先輩にも円香先輩にもなれない\r\n……小糸ちゃんみたいに頑張れない",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でもみんなも雛菜じゃないから\r\nできないとこも違うし、頑張ってるんだと思うな～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "知らないけどね～？\r\n雛菜は雛菜の気持ちしか知らないよ～……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "他の誰かにはなれないし\r\n雛菜はずっと雛菜でしかいられないでしょ～～～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから雛菜は、雛菜がしあわせ～って\r\n思える方を選ぶんだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……それじゃだめなの～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……本当にそれが、\r\n『雛菜のしあわせ』な方なら反対しないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だけど雛菜はどこかで、『ここまででいいや』って\r\n思ってるんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうやり方が必要な時もきっとある\r\nでも、きっとそれは今じゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──だって雛菜の『楽しい』って\r\n『楽をする』ってことじゃないだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………なんだ～～～\r\nそういうことか～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "プロデューサーが言いたかったこと\r\n雛菜、勘違いしてたみたい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "協調性がない～とか、みんなと一緒に自主練しろ～とか\r\nそういうことが言いたいのかと思ってた～～～",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうじゃないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そっか～……\r\nそんなに雛菜のこと、知ってるのか～",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……プロデューサーは、雛菜じゃないのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
