    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050220,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "──ね～、プロデューサー\r\n雛菜、アイドルにはなれると思う～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、なれるよ\r\nいや、もう雛菜はアイドルだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050230,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃあ雛菜が頑張ったら、\r\nいちばん褒めて、撫でてくれる～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうだな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だめだった時、ぎゅ～ってしてくれる～？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
