    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうしてくれ\r\n雛菜の幸せな姿が、周りの人を幸せにする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それは、間違いないから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050280,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……やっぱり雛菜、\r\nプロデューサーのことすきかも～～～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050290,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサーも\r\n雛菜のこと、すきでいてね～？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300105/1023001050290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな\r\n俺が一番最初の、雛菜のファンだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023001050300,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ほんと～！？\r\nやは～～～～～♡",
